SUMMARY:[Multimedia Learning & Retrieval][Computer Vision & Pattern Recogni
 tion] ICMR 2027 - Workshop proposal deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM SIGMM International Conference on Multime
 dia Retrieval\nWebsite: https://www.icmr2027.org/\nSource URL: https://ww
 w.icmr2027.org/date\nLocation: Singapore\nTopics: Multimedia Learning & R
 etrieval\, Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Machine Learning\, Dee
 p Representation Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Full and short paper
 s / multimedia retrieval\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-
 10-07\nNotes: Official dates explicitly use 23:59:59 AoE and confirm Sing
 apore\, June 7-10. Full/short and Brave New Ideas papers share January 31
 \; separate reproducibility/demo dates are not generalized to unrestricte
 d main papers. The regular-paper submission portal is not yet announced. 
 M is an editorial size estimate.\nScope: Search and retrieval of multimed
 ia and multimodal content. Characteristic work studies indexing\, content
  understanding\, query representations\, cross-modal matching\, relevance
  feedback\, recommendation\, and evaluation\, with deep learning and mult
 imodal models as important methods. Privacy-aware retrieval and knowledge
  discovery extend this core. The long applications list is not used to ch
 aracterize ICMR as a medicine\, finance\, or travel venue.\nAdditional to
 pics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, P
 rivacy-preserving ML\nScope sources (2027): https://www.icmr2027.org/cfc\
 nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www.icmr2027.org/date
END:VEVENT
